<view class="welcome-page">
  <view class="welcome-brand">
    <image class="welcome-mark" src="/assets/brand-mark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text>灵感拾光簿</text>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-hero">
    <view class="welcome-title">随手记录灵感<view>手动整理成稿</view></view>
    <view class="welcome-copy">写下一闪念，继续补充想法；把相关素材选在一起，编辑成自己要用的文字。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-block" bindtap="onStart">开始记录</button>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-section">
    <view class="welcome-section-title">从一句话，到一份稿</view>
    <view class="welcome-steps">
      <view class="welcome-step">
        <text class="welcome-step-number">1</text>
        <view class="welcome-step-content">
          <view class="welcome-step-title">记录想法</view>
          <view class="welcome-step-copy">一句随手记，也能成为一条灵感。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="welcome-step">
        <text class="welcome-step-number">2</text>
        <view class="welcome-step-content">
          <view class="welcome-step-title">继续补充</view>
          <view class="welcome-step-copy">打开已有灵感，接着写下新想到的内容。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="welcome-step">
        <text class="welcome-step-number">3</text>
        <view class="welcome-step-content">
          <view class="welcome-step-title">选材整理</view>
          <view class="welcome-step-copy">选择相关文字，手动编辑成稿，再复制或导出。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-section welcome-help">
    <view class="welcome-section-title">常见问题</view>
    <view class="welcome-question">
      <view class="welcome-question-title">只想到一句话，可以先记吗？</view>
      <view class="welcome-answer">可以。在「记录」写下这句话，保存后再回来补充。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="welcome-question">
      <view class="welcome-question-title">如何找到以前记过的想法？</view>
      <view class="welcome-answer">在「灵感」按正文、补充或标签搜索，也可以按时间和阶段筛选。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="welcome-question">
      <view class="welcome-question-title">怎样把几条想法整理成稿？</view>
      <view class="welcome-answer">在「灵感」选择素材并调整顺序，进入稿件后手动编辑，可复制文字或导出 TXT。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-footer">
    <button class="btn btn-quiet btn-block" open-type="share">分享给微信好友</button>
    <view class="welcome-hint">分享到朋友圈，可用右上角菜单。</view>
  </view>
</view>
